Revision history for Perl extension Mojolicious-Plugin-WebComponent

{{$NEXT}}
    - BREAKING: the script url is now /component/:checksum/*component, where the checksum is the SHA-1 of the rendered script, replacing the per-request id; urls are stable until the script, template or parameters change
    - script responses carry Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable when the checksum matches, and no-cache otherwise
    - the requestId helper option replaces the checksum and is served with no-cache

0.07 2024-03-23T16:52:32Z
    - updates to better handle reverse proxy installations where generated urls were not being handled correctly

0.06 2024-03-01T13:47:49Z
    - fix a bug in the content injection where some invalid string data was left from a previous revision causing a javascript error

0.05 2024-03-01T13:29:53Z
    - remove manifest.t from test suite, not needed for this distribution

0.04 2024-02-29T17:30:05Z
    - update to fix test errors from github test runners failing due to node.js error introduced by default test.yaml
    - increase minimum Perl version to fix test failure due to Mojolicious -signatures feature requiring v5.20+

0.03 2024-02-29T17:08:39Z
    - update minimum Perl version

0.02 2024-02-29T17:00:34Z
    - initial release

0.01 2024-02-29T16:05:19Z

